{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/sec-hoefsmit-convergence-construction-per-partition-k-preamble","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Prose","doco:Section"],"label":"sec:hoefsmit-convergence-construction-per-partition-k-preamble","kind":"prose","text":"hoefsmit-convergence-construction-per-partition-k-intro.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"sec:hoefsmit-convergence-construction-per-partition-k-preamble\"></a><p>The global convergence of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z</code>-Habiro brane tower rests on the decay rate of individual Wedderburn blocks <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_\\lambda</code> as the partition depth increases. This section tabulates the per-partition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z</code>-Habiro evaluations across ranks <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k = 1, \\dots, 8</code>, exhibiting the geometric decay across partition rows that concentrates the Markov trace on the leading two-row stratum.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hoefsmit-convergence-construction-per-partition-k-intro.md","heading":"","page":"b/sec-hoefsmit-convergence-construction-per-partition-k-preamble","qa":{"counts":{"pass":57,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":18,"unknown":0,"stale":58},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}}}
